ge Base list. Choose a knowledge base to search"><option value="null" aria-label="Choose to search all the available knowledge bases">-- All --</option><option value="5c45a3a0d712120023c84f80de61038b" aria-label="Choose to search Social QA knowledge base">Social QA</option><option value="05ff44289f011200550bf7b6077fcfa3" aria-label="Choose to search Customer Service knowledge base">Customer Service</option></select></div><br></br></div><button class="btn btn-primary kb-btn-primary" type="submit" aria-label="Search button. Click to search the entered text">Search</button></div></form></div></td></tr></table><table class="wide" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-bottom: 8px;"><tr><td><form method="GET" action="ui_page_render.do" name="ui_page_render.do"><input type="HIDDEN" name="sys_action" id="sys_action" value="none"></input><input type="HIDDEN" name="sys_id" id="sys_id" value="3e8225b2876e2e10f7b8a7dd3fbb355a"></input><input type="HIDDEN" name="view_id" id="view_id" value="da21426793624f108f44f89a2603d6a2"></input><input type="HIDDEN" name="sysparm_modify_check" id="sysparm_modify_check" value="true"></input><input type="HIDDEN" name="sysparm_article" id="sysparm_article" value="KB0010432"></input><input type="HIDDEN" name="sysparm_base_form" id="sysparm_base_form" value="ui_page_render"></input><input type="HIDDEN" name="sysparm_view" id="sysparm_view" value=""></input><table class="wide" cellspacing="0"><tr class="header kb_header_title_row"><td><table border="0" class="wide" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><tr class="header" border="0" cellspacing="0"><td><input type="HIDDEN" id="sysverb_back"></input></td><td width="100%"><div class="caption" style="margin-top: 2px;">Customer Service&nbsp;&gt;&nbsp;<a href="kb_list.do?jvar_view_topic=General&amp;sysparm_kb_search_table=&amp;sysparm_language=&amp;sysparm_nameofstack=&amp;sysparm_refer=kb_view_customer.do?sysparm_article=KB0010432" class="caption_link_chevron" title="Topic: General">General</a>&nbsp;&gt;

					    OneLogin Domains and IP addresses
</div></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="color:#999999;font-size: 80%;padding-top:6px;padding-bottom:8px;"><div class="kb_article_header_short_description">OneLogin Domains and IP addresses</div><div class="kb_article_header_info"><span style="font-weight:bold;">Article:</span>&nbsp;KB0010432
		<span style="font-weight:bold;padding-left:8px;">Published:</span>&nbsp;07/09/2025
			<span style="font-weight:bold;padding-left:8px;">Last modified:</span>&nbsp;07/09/2025
	</div></td></tr><tr><td><table><tr><td></td><td class="kb_text" valign="top"><p><link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet" crossorigin="anonymous"></p>
<div class="alert alert-primary">
<p>This document provides the domains, ports, and IP addresses that OneLogin uses to communicate with other services.</p>
<ul>
<li>Use <strong>domain</strong> allow lists for your end-user systems that access the OneLogin SSO portal and other user interfaces.</li>
<li>Use <strong>IP</strong> allow lists for on-premises agents, like Active Directory connectors and LDAP connectors, as well as for apps provisioned by OneLogin.</li>
</ul>
<p class="alert alert-danger"><strong>Note:</strong> We do not support access from anonymous IP addresses.</p>
</div>
<div class="card border-secondary mb-3" style="width: fit-content;">
<div class="card-header">
<p>Table of Contents</p>
</div>
<div class="card-body text-secondary">
<div class="mce-toc">
<ul>
<li><a href="#domains">Domains</a>
<ul>
<li><a href="#domains-us">North America Domains</a>
<ul>
<li><a href="#domains-us-back">Backward-Compatible North America Domains</a></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li><a href="#domains-eu">Europe Domains</a></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li><a href="#ports">Ports</a></li>
<li><a href="#ips">IP Addresses</a>
<ul>
<li><a href="#ips-us">North America IP Addresses</a></li>
<li><a href="#ips-eu">Europe IP Addresses</a></li>
<li><a href="#ips-email">Email IP Addresses</a></li>
<li><a href="#ips-radius">NAS IPs for RADIUS Servers</a></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li><a href="#tls">TLS configuration</a></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<hr>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<h1 id="domains">Domains</h1>
<table class="table table-striped" style="width: fit-content;">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>
<p><code><mark><em>your-domain</em></mark>.onelogin.com</code></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>
<p><code>cdn.onelogin.com</code></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>
<p><code>portal-cdn.onelogin.com</code></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>
<p><code>web-login-v2-cdn.onelogin.com</code></p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
